REPLACE THIS FILE WITH: theme_ntp_background.png
- Role   : Full-page background of the New Tab Page
- Size   : 1920 × 1080 px minimum; 3840 × 2160 px for HiDPI displays
- Format : PNG or JPG  (JPG is acceptable here to reduce file size)
- Tips   : This is the most visible part of your theme — use your
           hero image / wallpaper here.
           Set ntp_background_alignment and ntp_background_repeat in
           manifest.json to control how it is positioned.
